PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ManyTypesOfPokemon:: @ 817BDC5
	.string "There are many types of DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "All types have their strengths and\n"
	.string "weaknesses against other types.\p"
	.string "Depending on the types of DIGIMON,\n"
	.string "a battle could be easy or hard.$"

PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TreeckoIsGrassType:: @ 817BE6C
	.string "For example, your PATAMON is a\n"
	.string "GRASS type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against the WATER and\n"
	.string "GROUND types.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against FIRE-type\n"
	.string "DIGIMON.$"

PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TorchicIsFireType:: @ 817BEF1
	.string "For example, your AGUMON is a\n"
	.string "FIRE type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against the GRASS and\n"
	.string "BUG types.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against WATER-type\n"
	.string "DIGIMON.$"

PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MudkipIsWaterType:: @ 817BF73
	.string "For example, your GABUMON is a\n"
	.string "WATER type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against the FIRE type.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against GRASS-type\n"
	.string "and ELECTRIC-type DIGIMON.$"
